    "page_content": "4.2 Sample Selection Approach\n- Population: Multi-element contracts booked Oct 2024–Jan 2025 (n = 58)\n- Sample size: 10 contracts, judgmentally selected to include higher-value and higher-variance arrangements\n5. Testing Procedures Performed\n- Obtained standard list price catalogue from Pricing Team\n- Recalculated SSP allocation using the approved formula\n- Compared recalculated allocation to system-booked values\n- For variances >20%, traced to Finance Manager sign-off evidence\n6. Findings Summary\n6.1 Recalculation Results\nCFO POLICY FRAMEWORK | CONTROLLED DOCUMENT Page 2",
